{{Documentation/Header}}
Create a collapsible using [[mw:Manual:Collapsible elements|collapsible elements]].

==Syntax==
{{T|Collapsible|v1=collapsible content|v2=button text|v3=collapsed=set to 1 to collapsed}}

==Examples==
{{T|Collapsible|_Y_=1}}
{{T|Collapsible|This content is visible by default|Default Expanded|_Y_=1}}
{{T|Collapsible|This content is not visible by default|Press me to see content|collapsed=1|_Y_=1}}

